# Denver TAC-70051 dedicated panel profile.
#
# The AXP20 PMIC reports the enclosure power button as Linux key 116. Mapping
# it to Android POWER tears down the legacy camera whenever it is pressed,
# preventing motion wake. Map it to CAMERA instead; WallPanel consumes that key
# as a dashboard wake request. The PMIC still handles hardware power-on while
# the tablet is fully off.
key 116   CAMERA            WAKE
